<VEF.Abilities.AbilityDef ParentName="VPE_PsycastBase">
	<defName>VPE_Pyromancer_PsionicKindling_Ability_STNL</defName>
	<label>Psionic kindling</label>
	<description>Evolutive passive:\n\nFire/Burn damage now deals a second instance of damage that inflicts a fraction of the original damage.\n\nEvolution effect: Damage increases proportionally to the amount of known Pyromancer psycasts.\n\nSecondary evolution: Psionic phoenix\n\nEvolution requirement: Unlock every Pyromancer psycast.\n\nEvolution effect: Upon death, this Pyromancer will disperse into ash to recover from their wounds and will return after a few days.</description>
	<iconPath>UI_Pyromancer_STNL/Abilities/Ability_PsionicKindling</iconPath>
	<abilityClass>SentinelFramework_STNL.Ability_PassiveGiver</abilityClass>
